ry/_/id/50491637/connelly-college-football-best-races","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"SEC fines Arkansas $500K for allowing fans to storm field vs. South Carolina","description":"The Southeastern Conference fined Arkansas $500,000 on Sunday for allowing fans to storm the field following a 34-6 victory over No. 17 South Carolina.","published":"2026-11-15T22:01:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50493903/sec-fines-arkansas-500k-allowing-fans-storm-field-vs-south-carolina","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Clemson QB Tait Reynolds has torn meniscus, Christopher Vizzina a concussion","description":"Clemson lost starting QB Tait Reynolds for the rest of the season with a torn meniscus, while backup Christopher Vizzina has a concussion.","published":"2026-11-15T21:09:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50493355/reynolds-torn-meniscus-vizzina-concussion","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Minnesota fires OC Greg Harbaugh Jr., ending third stint with Gophers","description":"Minnesota fired offensive coordinator Greg Harbaugh Jr. as the Golden Gophers rank 15th in the Big Ten in scoring and 17th in yards per game.","published":"2026-11-15T19:36:27.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50491908/minnesota-fires-oc-greg-harbaugh-jr-ending-3rd-gophers-stint","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Allstate Playoff Predictor","description":"Select your favorite contender, make your picks for how its season will play out and see what the Allstate Playoff Predictor foretells.","published":"2026-11-15T18:13:44.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/feature/story/_/page/cfbplayoffpredictor/college-football-allstate-playoff-bracket-predictor","type":"Eticket","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 NFL draft questions, latest intel, risers, CFB standouts","description":"Is Jackson Harris the WR3 in the class? And has Boubacar Traore emerged as the No. 3 edge rusher? Here's our weekly draft spin, including top standouts.","published":"2026-11-15T17:34:06.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/draft2027/story/_/id/49881131/2027-nfl-draft-risers-questions-college-football-prospects","type":"Story","byline":"Mel Kiper Jr. and Jordan Reid","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5146422/xavier-gilliam","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xavier_Gilliam"},"pick":{"pick":18,"round":1,"team":"CLE","via":"LAR","provisional":false},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Xavier Gilliam","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xavier_Gilliam","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:38:11Z","intro":"Xavier Harold Gilliam is an American football defensive tackle for the Tennessee Volunteers. He previously played for the Penn State Nittany Lions.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Gilliam attended Wilde Lake High School in Columbia, Maryland and Quince Orchard High School in Gaithersburg, Maryland. He committed to play college football for the Penn State Nittany Lions over offers from Boston College, Maryland, Ole Miss, Texas A&M, West Virginia, and Virginia Tech."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a freshman at Penn State in 2024, Gilliam was redshirted. During the 2025 season, he appeared in 13 games with two starts, totaling 15 tackles with two for loss, a forced fumble, and a blocked field goal. After the conclusion of the season, Gilliam entered the NCAA transfer portal.\nGilliam transferred to play for the Tennessee Volunteers. In the 2026 season opener, he posted six tackles with five for loss, and three sacks in a win over Furman."}]}}